# This repo publishes straight to medmatchglobal.info via GitHub Pages —
# anything committed here becomes publicly downloadable. Keep local tool
# output and scratch files out of it.
#
# Note: _archive/ is intentionally TRACKED. The leading underscore is what
# stops GitHub Pages from publishing it (verified 404 live). Do not add it here.

# Agent tooling output (browse logs, network captures, audit trails)
.gstack/

# graphify knowledge-graph cache (generated from the codebase)
graphify-out/

# Dependencies, if anything ever needs them locally
node_modules/

# Logs and scratch
*.log
*.tmp

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
